BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:w1-wed-run@marathon2026
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20260820T070000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20260820T073000
SUMMARY:🟢 Easy run — 6 km
DESCRIPTION:Pace: 6:45–7:15 /km\n\nFirst run at the correct easy pace — deliberately slower than feels natural. Flat route. Check average pace on Strava after: aim for 6:45–7:20.\n\n--- BEFORE RUN (10 min) ---\n• Clamshells 3×15 each side\n• Side-lying hip abduction 3×15 each side\n• Single-leg glute bridge 3×12 each side\n• Hip flexor stretch 60 sec each side\n• TFL foam roll 60 sec each side\n\n--- EVENING (15 min) ---\n• Monster walks 3×15 steps\n• Step-downs 3×12 each side\n• IT band stretch 3×45 sec each side\n• Pigeon pose 90 sec each side\n• Lateral band walks 3×20 steps\n• Single-leg calf raises 3×15 each side
CATEGORIES:Run,Easy
COLOR:GREEN
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:w1-thu-physio@marathon2026
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20260821T200000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20260821T201500
SUMMARY:💜 Physio session — 15 min
DESCRIPTION:No run today.\n\n--- EVENING (15 min) ---\n• Monster walks 3×15 steps\n• Step-downs 3×12 each side\n• IT band stretch 3×45 sec each side\n• Pigeon pose 90 sec each side\n• Lateral band walks 3×20 steps\n• Single-leg calf raises 3×15 each side
CATEGORIES:Physio
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:w1-sat-long@marathon2026
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20260822T080000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20260822T091500
SUMMARY:🔵 Long run — 10 km
DESCRIPTION:Pace: 7:00–7:30 /km\n\nEasy and controlled throughout. Walk 1 min at km 5 as a planned break. If the left knee gives any sensation, slow to 7:45. Ice the knee after.\n\n--- BEFORE RUN (10 min) ---\n• Clamshells 3×15 each side\n• Side-lying hip abduction 3×15 each side\n• Single-leg glute bridge 3×12 each side\n• Hip flexor stretch 60 sec each side\n• TFL foam roll 60 sec each side
CATEGORIES:Run,Long
COLOR:BLUE
END:VEVENT

