DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20260919T115000
SUMMARY:🔵 Long run — 28–30 km ★
DESCRIPTION:Pace: 7:00–7:30 /km\n\n★ MOST IMPORTANT SESSION OF THE ENTIRE PLAN ★\n\nWalk 90 sec every 5 km from the very start — structural, not weakness. Gel at km 12 and km 22. If knee tightens after km 20, slow to 8:00 and walk every 3 km. Complete the distance even if slow. Only cut short if there is sharp pain.\n\n--- BEFORE RUN (10 min) ---\n• Clamshells 3×15 each side\n• Side-lying hip abduction 3×15 each side\n• Single-leg glute bridge 3×12 each side\n• Hip flexor stretch 60 sec each side\n• TFL foam roll 60 sec each side
CATEGORIES:Run,Long
COLOR:BLUE
END:VEVENT

