BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:w9-race@marathon2026
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261025T080000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261025T124500
SUMMARY:🏅 MARATHON — 25 Oct 2026
DESCRIPTION:TARGET: 4:30 finish (6:24 /km)\n\n--- RACE MORNING ---\n−3 h: Wake up, familiar breakfast (oats, banana, coffee)\n−60 min: Full IT band physio routine — non-negotiable\n−20 min: Easy 5 min jog + dynamic leg swings\n\n--- PACING STRATEGY ---\nkm 0–5:   6:35–6:45 /km — deliberately slow, let people pass\nkm 5–20:  6:20–6:30 /km — settle into pace, high cadence\nkm 20–30: 6:20–6:30 /km — hold form, walk 90 sec every 5 km\nkm 30–35: 6:30–7:00 /km — IT band danger zone, walk if needed\nkm 35–42: Run on feel. Walk downhills. Finish.\n\nIf taking ibuprofen: at km 30 with a gel, not on empty stomach.
CATEGORIES:Race
COLOR:YELLOW
END:VEVENT

END:VCALENDAR
